    "Condition : 1 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the reports, specifications and drawings detailed Site Location Plan dated 5th of April 2026 and 0864 / C288092 / 120 REV A.\r\nReason: To ensure a satisfactory standard of development and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme. \r\n",
